            "about": "Age: 12\nHeight: 142cm\nHair: Red\nEyes: Green\nBlood Type: B\nConstellation: Aquarius\nOccupation: Body double\n\nFern is part of a race of creatures that has a high resistance to magic, called the Hahze (or Onburu). Not entirely human in appearance, Fern had very few friends growing up. He eventually became assigned to Sylthfarn as a body double (if someone used a harmful spell on Sylthfarn, it would transfer to Fern). Sylthfarn eventually convinced Fern they should be friends, and Fern was deeply hurt when Sylthfarn disappeared with word.\n\nFern tends to be brash, rude, and sarcastic to those he doesn't know, but he is extremely loyal the people he cares about.\n\nNo voice actors have been added to this character. Help improve our database by searching for a voice actor, and adding this character to their roles ."
